{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1489624-any-ideas-for-a-potential-5th-edition","id":1489624,"title":"Any ideas for a potential 5th Edition?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-08-10T04:28:01-07:00","id":1489624,"title":"Any ideas for a potential 5th Edition?","content":"Been thinking about this for a while now. With Vampire and Hunter 5th out, and Werewolf and Mage 5th both being worked on, I've gotten curious about what the other splats would look like in a modern 5th Edition. <br /> <br /> Does anyone have any potential speculation on what a 5th Edition of Changeling might end up looking like? Given the prevailing theme of rebelling against higher powers in 5th Ed. splats, I imagine that there could be some potential ideas for a modern Changeling setting. I don't actually know much about the splat myself; I'm mostly a Vampire player, with a bit of Mage and Werewolf on the side, so any idea what you guys think would be the story for Changeling 5th? Protagonists, antagonists, that sort of thing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27528-just-some-guy","name":"Just Some Guy","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-08-10T05:34:37-07:00","id":1489626,"title":"","content":"Having the commoner revolution be either in progress or succeeded in Concordia would certainly fit that theme.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10243-zenten","name":"ze